DVS[0]=1: short pulse width
DVS[0]=0: long pulse width
dvs[3:1] is delay option control words when DVSE=1.
DVS[3:1] = 000: loosest margin.
DVS[3:1] = 001
DVS[3:1] = 010
DVS[3:1] = 011
...</description>
