              <description>ECO: enable to shutdown dq pads when idle, for both ddr and psram
must be set after configuring pwdpad_idle_val
Note:  only stop psram auto axi access, manually enable/disable this bit when using psram user axi access</description>
              <bitRange>[0:0]</bitRange>
