* 0: OC5 active high
* 1: OC5 ative low
CC5 channel configured as input:
* 0: positive edge of TRGI is active for capture
* 1: negative edge of TRGI is active for capture</description>
              <bitRange>[26:26]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>OC5PE</name>
