              <description>Enable CC1</description>
              <bitRange>[24:24]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>CCR1</name>
              <description>Capture/Compare 1 value
CC1 channel configured as output: CCR1 is the value to be loaded in the actual capture/compare 1 register (preload value). It is loaded permanently if the preload feature is not selected in the OC1PE bit. Else the preload value is copied in the active capture/compare 1 register when an UEV occurs. The active
