ck_en[2]: mck_dqs_0 
ck_en[3]: mck_dqs_1
ck_en[4]: mck_dqs_2 (No use)
ck_en[5]: mck_dqs_3 (No use)
ck_en[6]: mck_dq_0
ck_en[7]: mck_dq_1
ck_en[8]: mck_dq_2 (No use)
ck_en[9]: mck_dq_3 (No use)
ck_en[10]: mck_cs
ck_en[11]: mck_cs_1 (No use)
ck_en[12]: mck_ck_1 (No use)</description>
