            <field>
              <name>BIT_rate_sel</name>
              <description>New ARFR (REG 0x1484) rate group selection:
0: CCK1M - OFDM18M
1: OFDM24MRSVDOFDM54 , other no use
2: HT MCS0~MCS7
3: HT others, not use
4: VHT1SS/ MCS0~MCS7
5: VHT1SS/ MCS8~MCS9,other no use
6: HE 1SS / MCS0~MCS7
7: HE 1SS / MCS8~MCS9 ,other no use</description>
