0: GNT_BT_TX = GNT_BT &amp; BT_TX ;  GNT_BT_RX = GNT_BT &amp; BT_RX
1: GNT_BT_TX = GNT_BT &amp; (BT_TX | BT_BLE) ;  GNT_BT_RX = GNT_BT &amp; (BT_RX | BT_BLE)</description>
              <bitRange>[24:24]</bitRange>
